0..78 Comment "// Doc comments and the `doc` attribute, after the intra-doc links of rustdoc."
79..155 Comment "// A `[name]` in either resolves to a declaration of the source. A `[label]`"
156..232 Comment "// resolves to a footer line `[label]: target` at the end of its run. A link"
233..272 Comment "// that resolves to neither is refused."
